<div class="chroma-skin-button 
	{{unless skin.unlocked "locked"}} 
	{{if purchaseDisabled "purchase-disabled"}} 
	{{if isSelected "selected"}}" onmouseover={{action this "onEnter"}} onmouseout={{action this "onLeave"}} onmouseup={{action this "onClick"}}>
  {{#if skin.unlocked}}
    <div class="contents" style="background:{{color}}">
    </>
  {{else}}
    {{#if isSelected}}
      <div class="contents" style="background:{{color}}">
      </>
    {{/if}}
  {{/if}}
</>
